---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Contact • Volynx"
  description="How to contact Volynx for support, business, or partnerships."
>
  <div class="kicker">Support</div>
  <h1>Contact</h1>
  <p>Fastest way: email. If you include screenshots + links, response time improves dramatically (and everyone wins).</p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p><a href="mailto:contact@volynx.world">contact@volynx.world</a></p>

  <h2>What to include</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Page URL (or product name)</li>
    <li>What you expected vs what happened</li>
    <li>Browser + device</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Business &amp; partnerships</h2>
  <p>Send a short brief with goals, deadline, and budget range.</p>
</LegalLayout>
